{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/6.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/4.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/5.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How can you defeat the powerful princesses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn a variety of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reincarnate in infinite rebirths to gain even greater power</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565010?t=1744352891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565010?t=1744352891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/6166c180a6564d4bffa65619d92057e84c111bf7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744352891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/6166c180a6564d4bffa65619d92057e84c111bf7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744352891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/6.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/4.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/5.png?t=1744352891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How can you defeat the powerful princesses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn a variety of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reincarnate in infinite rebirths to gain even greater power</p>","developers":["\u6a61\u6811\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"descript